---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CTA from '../../components/CTA.astro';
---
<Layout title="Employment & Immigration Lawyers in Barcelona | Spain" description="Employment and immigration lawyers in Barcelona advising individuals and businesses across Spain. English-language enquiries welcome.">
  <section class="hero hero-home">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Barcelona · Spain · In person and online</span>
        <h1>Legal advice that helps you understand what to do next.</h1>
        <p class="lead">We advise <strong>individuals and businesses</strong> on employment and immigration matters, focusing on the facts, documents and dates that can change your options.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/en/contact" data-track="primary_cta_click">Contact the firm</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+34695385198" data-track="phone_click">Call +34 695 385 198</a></div>
        <p class="hero-note">You do not need to know the legal terminology before contacting us. Tell us what happened and when.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="hero-panel hero-panel-premium" aria-label="Common legal situations">
        <span class="card-kicker">What are you dealing with?</span>
        <div class="route-list">
          <a href="/en/employment-dismissal"><span>01</span><strong>I have been dismissed</strong><small>Dismissal letter · settlement · severance · deadlines</small></a>
          <a href="/en/immigration"><span>02</span><strong>I need immigration advice in Spain</strong><small>Residence · nationality · family · regularisation</small></a>
          <a href="/en/business"><span>03</span><strong>I run a company</strong><small>Employment decisions · contracts · disputes · recurring advice</small></a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <div class="container proof-line" aria-label="Service approach"><span>Clear explanations</span><span>Dates and deadlines</span><span>Direct contact</span><span>Official sources</span></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section-paper" data-reveal><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Core services</span><h2>Start with the problem, not the legal label.</h2></div><p>These are the areas where the English section is designed to get you to the relevant information and contact route quickly.</p></div><div class="cards">
    <a class="card card-featured" href="/en/employment"><div><span class="card-kicker">Employment law</span><h3>Dismissal, severance, salary and workplace issues</h3><p>For employees and companies who need to review a decision, document or employment dispute in Spain.</p></div><span class="link-arrow">Employment law in Barcelona →</span></a>
    <a class="card" href="/en/immigration"><div><span class="card-kicker">Immigration</span><h3>Residence, nationality, family and regularisation</h3><p>For international clients who need to understand the route, evidence and next step in Spain.</p></div><span class="link-arrow">Immigration lawyers in Barcelona →</span></a>
    <a class="card" href="/en/business"><div><span class="card-kicker">Business</span><h3>Employment advice for companies</h3><p>Practical support before sensitive employment decisions become disputes.</p></div><span class="link-arrow">Business employment advice →</span></a>
  </div></div></section>
  <section class="section"><div class="container split"><div><span class="eyebrow">When time matters</span><h2>Bring us the document, the date and the outcome you need.</h2></div><div class="prose"><ol><li><strong>What happened?</strong> Give us the essential facts.</li><li><strong>When did it happen?</strong> Dates and deadlines may change the analysis.</li><li><strong>What do you need?</strong> Advice, negotiation, a claim, an application or a review of documents.</li></ol><p><a href="/en/contact">Send the essential information →</a></p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section section-dark"><div class="container split split-wide"><div><span class="eyebrow">Built for international clients</span><h2>English-language contact from a Barcelona law firm.</h2></div><div class="prose light-copy"><p>Our English pages are designed around the questions people actually ask when they need legal help in Spain: what applies, what documents matter and how to contact the firm quickly.</p><div class="pill-row"><span class="pill">Barcelona</span><span class="pill">Spain</span><span class="pill">English</span><span class="pill">In person</span><span class="pill">Online</span></div><p><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/en/about">How we work →</a></p></div></div></section>
  <CTA title="Need to know what to do next?" text="Tell us briefly what happened, when it happened and what you need to resolve." label="Contact the firm" />
</Layout>
